      "widgets_values": [
        "CAMERA FACE COLOR + PROJECTION WORKFLOW\n\n1) Upload a screenshot or camera capture in the LoadImage node.\n2) Edit the green positive prompt to describe face paint, a material, or color palette.\n3) Keep denoise at 0.25-0.45 to preserve the captured face. Increase it only for a stronger style change.\n4) Run the workflow. SaveImage always writes PNG files.\n\n3D_Face_Color_RGBA is an RGBA PNG with transparent background.\n3D_Face_Stencil is a white-face / black-background mask. Set ThresholdMask to 0.35 for softer edges or 0.65 for a harder cut.\n\nBiRefNet uses the original capture for the boundary, so the generated colors do not change the projection silhouette. Use a close-up or a plain background for the cleanest face mask."
